    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"933054\">Snir Broshi</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/List.2EnotMem_subset/near/583148318\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">notMem_subset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l'</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∉</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l'</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∉</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">notMem_subset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ha</span>\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Bad idea :)</p>\n<p>There's no <code>SetLike</code> in sight:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">notMem_subset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">12</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∉</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Mem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l'</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">12</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∉</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Mem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 583195102,
        "sender_full_name": "Ruben Van de Velde",
        "timestamp": 1775113900
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh so this is just defeq abuse between <code>Set α</code> and <code>α → Prop</code>?</p>",
        "id": 583254411,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1775133020
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Well then how about we introduce <code>SetLike (List α)</code>? That'll give new <code>Membership</code> and <code>HasSubset</code> instances, but they would be defeq to the ones in core so it'll be fine hopefully</p>",
        "id": 583254542,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1775133062
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"459227\">Violeta Hernández</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/List.2EnotMem_subset/near/583179832\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>isn't this just a contrapositive?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"307953\">Ruben Van de Velde</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/List.2EnotMem_subset/near/583147751\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>mt (List.subset_def.mp h) ha</code> isn't much better</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 583254865,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1775133175
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><code>List</code> isn't <code>SetLike</code> because you can have multiple lists corresponding to the same set (for example <code>[0]</code> and <code>[0, 0]</code>)</p>",
        "id": 583267030,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1775136533
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh <code>SetLike</code> requires injectivity? damn</p>",
        "id": 583269920,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1775137252
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I have now opened <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/37561\">#37561</a> adding <code>List.notMem_subset</code></p>",
        "id": 583325699,
        "sender_full_name": "Iván Renison",
        "timestamp": 1775153296
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh you could also <code>(ha &lt;| h ·)</code> if you prefer</p>",
